      "supports": "WIP schedule updated monthly as part of the close with contract value, costs and revenue to date, percent complete, billings and contract assets and liabilities; revenue recognised on cost incurred; project managers and accounting meet regularly to review; schedule reconciled to the income statement and balance sheet; sureties may require monthly WIP reports."
